 "intro": "Markers for saying it again, correcting yourself, giving an example and changing the subject.",
 "palabras": [
  {
   "palabra": "es decir",
   "significado": "that is to say",
   "pron": "es de-THIR",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It follows a hard idea and explains it another way. It takes commas.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "o sea",
   "significado": "I mean, in other words",
   "pron": "o SE-a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is very spoken: used a lot in conversation. In writing, «es decir» is better.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "en otras palabras",
   "significado": "in other words",
   "pron": "en O-tras pa-LA-bras",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "«Palabras» is feminine plural, hence «otras». It is more formal than «o sea».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "mejor dicho",
   "significado": "or rather",
   "pron": "me-HOR DI-cho",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "Use it to correct yourself: «llega hoy, mejor dicho, mañana». The j sounds like h.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "en concreto",
   "significado": "specifically",
   "pron": "en kon-KRE-to",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It follows something general: «quiero viajar, en concreto, a Perú».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "de hecho",
   "significado": "in fact",
   "pron": "de E-cho",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "The h is silent: «de hecho» sounds like «de echo». It backs up what you said before.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "en realidad",
   "significado": "actually, in reality",
   "pron": "en rre-a-li-DAD",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is the English «actually». Do not mix it up with «actualmente», which means «now».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "por cierto",
   "significado": "by the way",
   "pron": "por THYER-to",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It brings in a topic you have just remembered. A synonym is «a propósito».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "en fin",
   "significado": "anyway, well",
   "pron": "en fin",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It closes a topic with a sigh: «en fin, qué le vamos a hacer». It is very spoken.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "pues",
   "significado": "well, so",
   "pron": "pwes",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "conjunction",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is very common at the start of an answer: «pues, no sé». It buys thinking time.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "ya",
   "significado": "I see, right",
   "pron": "ya",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "interjection",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "Said alone and short, «ya» means «I get it». It also means «already».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
