   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Steering the conversation",
     "texto": [
      "These markers help you steer a conversation:\n\n- to explain again: **es decir**, **o sea**, **en otras palabras**\n- to correct yourself: **mejor dicho**\n- to give an exact case: **en concreto**\n- to back up what you said with a fact: **de hecho**\n- to set the record straight: **en realidad**\n- to change the subject: **por cierto**\n- to wrap up, a little resigned: **en fin**\n\nIn speech, **pues** and **ya** buy time and soften what follows.\n\nBeware of the false friend **actualmente**: it means «now». «Actually» is **en realidad** or **de hecho**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Rewording, correcting and nuancing",
     "texto": [
      "Each marker does a different job:\n\n- **Saying it another way**: es decir, o sea, en otras palabras\n- **Correcting yourself**: mejor dicho\n- **Giving an exact case**: en concreto\n- **Backing up with a fact**: de hecho\n- **Setting things straight**: en realidad\n\nAll of them go at the start of the sentence and take a **comma**. «De hecho» adds; «en realidad» contradicts an impression."
     ],
